  "referenceNumber": "IRN0216",
  "remarks": "\nAbdolfatah\n Ahvazian \nis an involved person within the meaning of the Iran (Sanctions) Regulations 2023 because \nAbdolfatah Ahvazian \nis or has been involved in hostile activity by the Government of Iran, namely threatening, planning or conducting activity which is intended to cause the destabilisation of the United Kingdom or any other country including activity which undermines or is intended to undermine the integrity, prosperity or security of the United Kingdom or any other country.  \n",
